      "id": "web-v8-queue-shutdown",
      "split": "diagnostic",
      "group": "fresh_web_excerpt",
      "family": "py-queue",
      "category": "condition_disjunction",
      "html": "<p>Raises <a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#asyncio.QueueShutDown\" title=\"asyncio.QueueShutDown\"><code class=\"xref py py-exc docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">QueueShutDown</span></code></a> if the queue has been shut down and\nis empty, or if the queue has been shut down immediately.</p>",
      "context_url": "https://docs.python.org/3/library/asyncio-queue.html",
      "source_text": "Raises QueueShutDown if the queue has been shut down and\nis empty, or if the queue has been shut down immediately.",
      "meaning_reference": "如果队列已被关闭并且为空，或者如果队列已被立即关闭则会引发 QueueShutDown。",
      "reference_html": "<p class=\"translated\">如果队列已被关闭并且为空，或者如果队列已被立即关闭则会引发 <a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#asyncio.QueueShutDown\" title=\"asyncio.QueueShutDown\"><code class=\"xref py py-exc docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">QueueShutDown</span></code></a>。</p>",
      "origin": {
