    {
      "id": "web-v8-queue-completion",
      "split": "diagnostic",
      "group": "fresh_web_excerpt",
      "family": "py-queue",
      "category": "counter_and_completion",
      "html": "<p>The count of unfinished tasks goes up whenever an item is added\nto the queue. The count goes down whenever a consumer coroutine calls\n<a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#asyncio.Queue.task_done\" title=\"asyncio.Queue.task_done\"><code class=\"xref py py-meth docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">task_done()</span></code></a> to indicate that the item was retrieved and all\nwork on it is complete.  When the count of unfinished tasks drops\nto zero, <code class=\"xref py py-meth docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">join()</span></code> unblocks.</p>",
      "context_url": "https://docs.python.org/3/library/asyncio-queue.html",
      "source_text": "The count of unfinished tasks goes up whenever an item is added\nto the queue. The count goes down whenever a consumer coroutine calls\ntask_done() to indicate that the item was retrieved and all\nwork on it is complete.  When the count of unfinished tasks drops\nto zero, join() unblocks.",
      "meaning_reference": "当条目添加到队列的时候，未完成任务的计数就会增加。每当消费协程调用 task_done() 表示这个条目已经被回收，该条目所有工作已经完成，未完成计数就会减少。当未完成计数降到零的时候， join() 阻塞被解除。",
      "reference_html": "<p class=\"translated\">当条目添加到队列的时候，未完成任务的计数就会增加。每当消费协程调用 <a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#asyncio.Queue.task_done\" title=\"asyncio.Queue.task_done\"><code class=\"xref py py-meth docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">task_done()</span></code></a> 表示这个条目已经被回收，该条目所有工作已经完成，未完成计数就会减少。当未完成计数降到零的时候， <a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#asyncio.Queue.join\" title=\"asyncio.Queue.join\"><code class=\"xref py py-meth docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">join()</span></code></a> 阻塞被解除。</p>",
      "origin": {
        "kind": "web_excerpt",
        "source": {
          "requested_url": "https://docs.python.org/3/library/asyncio-queue.html",
          "final_url": "https://docs.python.org/3/library/asyncio-queue.html",
          "status": 200,
          "bytes": 43813,
          "sha256": "eb495182e0ca2aa1ed0cdc38ee2ea2332da9d6389f3c5876e34c6d9defd8de19",
          "captured_utc": "2026-11-05T00:53:34.338576+00:00",
