    {
      "id": "web-v8-sqlite-neither",
      "split": "diagnostic",
      "group": "fresh_web_excerpt",
      "family": "py-sqlite",
      "category": "negation",
      "html": "<p>The context manager neither implicitly opens a new transaction\nnor closes the connection. If you need a closing context manager, consider\nusing <a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"contextlib.html#contextlib.closing\" title=\"contextlib.closing\"><code class=\"xref py py-meth docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">contextlib.closing()</span></code></a>.</p>",
      "context_url": "https://docs.python.org/3/library/sqlite3.html",
      "source_text": "The context manager neither implicitly opens a new transaction\nnor closes the connection. If you need a closing context manager, consider\nusing contextlib.closing().",
      "meaning_reference": "上下文管理器既不会隐式开启新事务也不会关闭连接。如果你需要关闭上下文管理器，请考虑使用 contextlib.closing()。",
      "reference_html": "<p class=\"translated\">上下文管理器既不会隐式开启新事务也不会关闭连接。如果你需要关闭上下文管理器，请考虑使用 <a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"contextlib.html#contextlib.closing\" title=\"contextlib.closing\"><code class=\"xref py py-meth docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">contextlib.closing()</span></code></a>。</p>",
