    {
      "id": "web-v8-abort-before",
      "split": "diagnostic",
      "group": "fresh_web_excerpt",
      "family": "mdn-abort",
      "category": "temporal",
      "html": "<p>The <strong><code>abort()</code></strong> method of the <a href=\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/AbortController\"><code>AbortController</code></a> interface aborts an asynchronous operation before it has completed.\nThis is able to abort <a href=\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/fetch\">fetch requests</a>, the consumption of any response bodies, or streams.</p>",
      "context_url": "https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/AbortController/abort",
      "source_text": "The abort() method of the AbortController interface aborts an asynchronous operation before it has completed.\nThis is able to abort fetch requests, the consumption of any response bodies, or streams.",
      "meaning_reference": "AbortController 接口的 abort() 方法会在一个异步操作完成之前中止它。它能够中止 fetch 请求、各种响应主体或者流的消耗。",
      "reference_html": "<p><a href=\"/zh-CN/docs/Web/API/AbortController\"><code>AbortController</code></a> 接口的 <strong><code>abort()</code></strong> 方法会在一个异步操作完成之前中止它。它能够中止 <a href=\"/zh-CN/docs/Web/API/Window/fetch\">fetch 请求</a>、各种响应主体或者流的消耗。</p>",
