      "split": "diagnostic",
      "group": "fresh_web_excerpt",
      "family": "mdn-abort",
      "category": "default_condition",
      "html": "<p>The reason why the operation was aborted, which can be any JavaScript value.\nIf not specified, the reason is set to \"AbortError\" <a href=\"/en-US/docs/Web/API/DOMException\"><code>DOMException</code></a>.</p>",
