    {
      "id": "web-v8-promise-reject",
      "split": "diagnostic",
      "group": "fresh_web_excerpt",
      "family": "mdn-all",
      "category": "any_all_conditions",
      "html": "<p><code>Promise.all()</code> will reject immediately upon <strong>any</strong> of the input promises rejecting. In comparison, the promise returned by <a href=\"/en-US/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Global_Objects/Promise/allSettled\"><code>Promise.allSettled()</code></a> will wait for all input promises to complete, regardless of whether or not one rejects. Use <code>allSettled()</code> if you need the final result of every promise in the input iterable.</p>",
      "context_url": "https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Global_Objects/Promise/all",
      "source_text": "Promise.all() will reject immediately upon any of the input promises rejecting. In comparison, the promise returned by Promise.allSettled() will wait for all input promises to complete, regardless of whether or not one rejects. Use allSettled() if you need the final result of every promise in the input iterable.",
      "meaning_reference": "Promise.all() 方法会在任何一个输入的 Promise 被拒绝时立即拒绝。相比之下，Promise.allSettled() 方法返回的 Promise 会等待所有输入的 Promise 完成，不管其中是否有 Promise 被拒绝。如果你需要获取输入可迭代对象中每个 Promise 的最终结果，则应使用 allSettled() 方法。",
      "reference_html": "<p><code>Promise.all()</code> 方法会在<strong>任何一个</strong>输入的 Promise 被拒绝时立即拒绝。相比之下，<a href=\"/zh-CN/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Global_Objects/Promise/allSettled\"><code>Promise.allSettled()</code></a> 方法返回的 Promise 会等待所有输入的 Promise 完成，不管其中是否有 Promise 被拒绝。如果你需要获取输入可迭代对象中每个 Promise 的最终结果，则应使用 <code>allSettled()</code> 方法。</p>",
      "origin": {
        "kind": "web_excerpt",
        "source": {
          "requested_url": "https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Global_Objects/Promise/all",
